n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ferwater</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Jerry's Junk</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">26,800$</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.55.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">May 10th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p><p><i><big>\"A drawer for all of your storage needs! Allows you to store items within the structure. Storage drawers have a limit of 250 per drawer, and only allow the same item &amp; type to be stored per drawer. With logic, an input of 100 can toggle the input lock on the drawer. An input from 1 to 10 will attempt to output x amount of it's contents.\"</big></i>\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p>The <b>Storage Drawer</b> is a structure that can be used to store up to 250 of a single item. The maximum dimensions are 8 x 8 x 8 studs. They can be bought at <a href=\"/wiki/Jerry%27s_Junk\" title=\"Jerry&#39;s Junk\">Jerry's Junk</a> shop beside the <a href=\"/wiki/Lighthouse\" title=\"Lighthouse\">Lighthouse</a> for 26,800$ each. There is also a smaller version, the <a href=\"/wiki/Micro_Storage_Drawer\" title=\"Micro Storage Drawer\">Micro Storage Drawer.</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260829080134\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.040 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 49/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 65/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019450/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   34.445      1 Template:Schematics\n100.00%   34.445      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2816-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260829080134 and revision id 21687. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Jerry's Junk","exists":true},{"title":"Lighthouse","exists":true},{"title":"Micro Storage Drawer","exists":true}],"images":["Storage_Drawer.png","Storage_Drawer_Schematic.png"]}
